        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "Isin, look!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_171_1#6",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "Oh... What a surprise. Did you weld this together with the steel you stole? What a magnificent piece."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_171_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "You're exaggerating. It doesn't matter how pretty it is; it's just consumables."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_171_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "But you must rest. Your broken arm has only just healed..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_171_1#6",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "Don't worry."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "Do you know where we can get some refined Originium?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_171_1#6",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "There is nothing that gold cannot buy in the Reefsteep Black Market."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_171_1#6",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "Let's see how this turns out, then..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
