            "name": "avg_npc_172_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "The black scorpion is dead..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "We've done well, haven't we?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "Old Isin heard from the fence today... The 'Sand Soldier' is the next ruler of Reefsteep."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "Do you think you are? Elliot?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1#6",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "And do you wish me to be, Isin?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "I'm not one to forget the kindness others have shown me. If it wasn't for you, I would not have survived these past two decades."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "Now you need Old Isin no more..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "No... Hardly. We have a special relationship, after all."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "But if you wanted to complain, perhaps you should complain to that lady who cloaked herself in all those mysteries."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "Kal'tsit..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "You still remember her name. You've gotten less and less clear-headed over the years. I thought you'd have forgotten that, among many other things."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "Have you looked for her?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1#6",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "Yes, I have, but my attempts have been futile. Not even my most elite intelligence agents could find any information about her in Columbia. Besides, the PMC disbanded not long after that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "The laboratory was taken over by the military, and all of their data were destroyed. I could not find even a single participant... Columbia hid them well."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
