    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sand Soldier",
        "text": "The Ibuti Lord Ameer will pass through Redhorn next week. Hoh, fate can be a fickle mistress sometimes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sand Soldier",
        "text": "This is an excellent opportunity\u2014Old Isin, are you asleep?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "Old Isin had a dream..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sand Soldier",
        "text": "Another one of your dreams?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "It was still the same dream as always... The Kheshig's footsteps went across the tundra and grasslands, at last reaching the land of golden sands."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "But, this time, the dream was a little different..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "It was a scenery that the padishah never recounted to Old Isin... There was someone there... She looked like... like Kal'tsit... in another form."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sand Soldier",
        "text": "Hm."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "She was there."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "When the Kheshigs' conquest shattered that bygone era all those thousands of years ago... she was there..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sand Soldier",
        "text": "Dreams can't explain much, and there are no Arts that allow us to glimpse into our fate across time. You said so yourself."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "Yes... This is merely a dream that Old Isin had... a meaningless dream... Lady Kal'tsit could not have had anything to do with them... but it does make Old Isin wonder if there is meaning to this dream."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "At the very end, Old Isin saw the padishah."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1#6",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sand Soldier",
        "text": "Oh? And what did your master tell you this time, old faithful?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1#6",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "He..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "In my dream... he told Old Isin... where Sargon is..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "You are planning to ambush the lord ameer's squadron."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sand Soldier",
        "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sand Soldier",
        "text": "So you mean to tell me that you, a former faithful aide to a Sargon noble, will stop me from disrespecting a lord ameer so?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "\u2014Disrespect?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1#6",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sand Soldier",
        "text": "Hm."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1#6",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "They are rotten and incompetent. They only know to bootlessly harm their kin and drag innocent Sargonians into war..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "They stand on Reefsteep's land, doing their dirty work. Why would Old Isin feel respect for men like them?"
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.5,
            "xstrength": 15,
            "ystrength": 15,
            "vibration": 20,
            "randomness": 70,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "Old Isin wants them to pay the price. Old Isin wants the glory of Sargon's past be restored, and not by these good-for-nothing clowns!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "Old Isin... Right... Old Isin must seek the city of golden sands!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sand Soldier",
        "text": "I don't see you get this excited often. Please, calm down\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_172_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "It's time..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "Go, my child. Light a fire, and complete your revenge."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Isin",
        "text": "Until the time comes when the winds finally calm and the eternal city rises from the sandstorm... Old Isin will wait... and Old Isin will reach that place..."
    },
