            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.4
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Looks like that gold coin made it to you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "How is Old Isin?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "He's lost to the golden sands... It happened one moonlit night three years ago."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "Time. Time can put to rest even a Savra like him. I almost thought him to be one of the ancient, elder beings in folk tales and conspiracy theories."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "Time has warped me so much, transforming me into a man my past self would have hated."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "And you, Kal'tsit?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "It looks like... nothing about you has changed."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Are you still the 'Sand Soldier?'"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "I already said this when I came onboard. That is all in the past. I have a new name now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "You can fool yourself... but you can't fool me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "Perhaps. You've always thought everything you said was absolute, and unfortunately for me, you were quite often right."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "You have always had a good memory, Elliot."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "Don't call me by that name... Don't we have these codenames exactly for this purpose, to shroud our secrets?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$rungeneral",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit\u2014Oh, my apologies. Do you have a visitor?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "No matter."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "Please, as you were."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3,
            "xstrength": 15,
            "ystrength": 15,
            "vibration": 20,
            "randomness": 70,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Okay..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "A Messenger from the field office in Victoria sent us a package. It's pretty strange, too. It's not addressed to Rhodes Island, but you personally. Logistics has already scanned the package. There's an information storage device inside."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "The sender's name is... Heidi Thomson. Do you know her?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "This is just some intel I needed. Leave it there."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Okay... that is all."
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.5
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$rungeneral",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "characteraction",
        "params": {
            "name": "left",
            "type": "move",
            "x": -300,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "A new conspiracy, I presume?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Watch your mouth. You may not officially be an operator here yet, but you signed a contract."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "Exactly what I expected our 'Operations Adviser' to say."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "Kal'tsit, you pointed Old Isin to a new direction, and for that he was forever grateful up until the moment he set out on his journey again."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "I cannot begin to imagine the glory you two shared, but now that my business in Sargon has been taken care of, there is nothing that binds me to this world anymore..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "I suppose you will point me in a new direction as well?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Before that... Let me introduce you to someone."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "Here I thought you would keep me close to you. Did you get me a partner?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "No."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Your commanding officer."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "A Rhodes Island commander? You... Hoh... There is someone whom you trust so deeply here? I look forward to meeting this person, then."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "Kal'tsit..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "You wandered the world for so long. How long will you stay here this time?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "You have no right to ask."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "Very well, of course. You needn't answer if you don't want to, as you are now my superior."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "But if this is yet another false identity, and this place where you belong is yet again false, then I am afraid it would hardly be meaningful for me to serve this place."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "How am I to tell you are not using me yet again?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "You have the right to be suspicious..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "I need only a little assurance. Will this 'Kal'tsit' who invited me here disappear all of a sudden in a few days, a few months, or perhaps a few years?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "Will she again set off on a journey to take care of some business that a bystander could never come to understand, to drift the world for her own purposes?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "Will you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "If a simple answer can affect your loyalty to Rhodes Island, then perhaps I must reevaluate this working relationship of ours."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "I only need an answer. An answer should not be so hard for you. I'll even accept a lie."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "If it is answers that you want, I have thousands of them."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Passenger",
        "text": "Then, please, pick any one of them."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "char_472_pasngr_n_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
