    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, here you are."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Good morning, Kal'tsit.;......;Something the matter?",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Closure has finished resupplying, but there seems to be an emergency there that needs your attention. Amiya is heading there already."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Don't keep her waiting. She has been working very hard, and you should be there at her side when she needs you the most."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Of course... That goes for you as well."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Don't push yourself too hard. Rhodes Island needs you."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Uhh... Thanks?;......;I know.",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I have an unexpected consultation to attend to in a moment, so I will leave it to you and Amiya to wrap things up."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "If things go well, perhaps we will get to announce to the whole ship before sundown\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "\u2014Time to set sail."
    },
